# Recommended build order

Don't try to make all five files "real" at once. Build incrementally:

**First build:** Placeholder index.mjs (serves a simple HTML page), placeholder
siddh_gateway.py (no-op loop), placeholder go2rtc.yaml (empty streams), zero-byte
ONNX. Boot it. Confirm Openbox + Chromium + installer work.

**Second build:** Real index.mjs (even a minimal one). Confirm the kiosk shows
your page.

**Third build:** Real go2rtc.yaml (with one camera). Confirm the stream appears
in go2rtc's WebUI at http://localhost:1984.

**Fourth build:** Real siddh_gateway.py + real gateway.toml. Confirm Modbus
readings appear in the SQLite DB.

**Fifth build:** Real ONNX model. Confirm AI inference runs.

Each build takes minutes, not hours. This incremental approach catches problems
early, before they're buried under other changes.
